  n<// Mask programmable revision cell. The cell generates a 4-bit value based> u<25> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<662> s<26> l<25:1> el<25:75>
  n<// on the output of four 9-input XOR-trees. Each XOR-tree has an input> u<26> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<662> s<27> l<26:1> el<26:71>
  n<// connection to each of Niagara's 9 metal layers. The inputs are connected> u<27> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<662> s<28> l<27:1> el<27:76>
